        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndabakoraniriza ku mugezi utemba uja Ahava, aho hantu tuhamara imisi itatu. Maze kuraba neza mu bantu no mu baherezi, nsanga nta Mulewi n’umwe arimwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ntoranya Eliyezeri, Ariyeli, Shemaya, Elunatani, Yaribu, Elunatani, Natani, Zakariya na Meshulamu, bari abarongozi, na Yoyaribu na Elunatani, bari abantu b’incabwenge, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "maze ndabarungika kwa Ido, umutware w’i Kasifiya. Ndababwira ivyo baza kubwira Ido na benewabo, abakozi bo mu Ngoro bari i Kasifiya, kugira ngo baturungikire abakozi bo kudufasha igikorwa co mu Ngoro y’Imana yacu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kubera ukuboko kw’ubuntu bw’Imana yacu kwari kumwe natwe, baturungikira Sherebiya, umuntu afise ugutahura, wo mu bakomotse kuri Mahuli mwene Lewi, Lewi mwene Isirayeli, n’abahungu n’abavukanyi ba Sherebiya, abagabo icumi n’umunani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Hashabiya, hamwe na Yeshaya wo mu bakomotse kuri Merari, n’abavukanyi biwe n’abahungwabo, abagabo mirongo ibiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bazana n’abandi amajana abiri na mirongo ibiri b’abakozi bo mu Ngoro, urwego Dawidi n’abaganwa biwe bari barashizeho ngo bafashe Abalewi. Bose barandikwa amazina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nyene ku nkombe z’umugezi uja muri Ahava, menyesha abantu ko bisonzesha, kugira ngo twicishe bugufi imbere y’Imana yacu duheze tuyisabe iduhe kugira urugendo rwiza twebwe n’abana bacu, n’ivyo dutunze vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko vyaranteye isoni gusaba umwami ingabo n’abagendera ku mafarasi bo kudukingira abansi bodutegera mu nzira, kandi twari twarabwiye umwami ko ukuboko kw’ubuntu bw’Imana yacu kuri kumwe n’umuntu wese amuhanze amaso, ariko ko uburake bwiwe buri ku bamutera ibitugu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko turisonzesha twinginga Imana yacu ku bw’ivyo, na yo yishura ugusenga kwacu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
